  "title": "JBT Marel adds Flip & Wash bin washer demos at Lakeland Customer Innovation Center",
  "summary": "JBT Marel has added a Flip & Wash bin washer to its Lakeland Customer Innovation Center, giving fruit and vegetable processors a new opportunity to see automated bin washing technology in action. Now available for customer demonstrations, the system is designed to clean the interior and exterior surfaces of produce bins while supporting more consistent, efficient cleaning operations.",
